ng itself...\"  \n- **Core**: Compare to a Russian doll (each doll opens to reveal a smaller one).  \n- **Conclusion**: \"It’s powerful for tasks like traversing file directories.\"  \n\n**References**  \n- *Talk Like TED* by Carmine Gallo (for engaging explanations).  \n- Coursera’s *Technical Communication* course (structure tips).  \n\n**Next Steps**  \n1. Choose your topic and outline.  \n2. Record and assess.  \n3. Iterate until you’re confident in your delivery."
